{
  "name": "Day 34 Solution: Production Optimization Mastery",
  "description": "Weighted 0-100 optimization score (divide-by-zero guarded) branching into 4 real optimization actions only when below threshold, converging to one report.",
  "tags": [
    "week-05",
    "day-34",
    "solution"
  ],
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "sticky1",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        40,
        -340
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Day 34 Solution: Production Optimization Mastery\n\nWebhook -> Code (weighted 0-100 optimization score, guarded against divide-by-zero) -> IF score<80 -> 4 real Set-node fixes (trim/dedupe/round/flag) -> both branches converge on Generate Optimization Report. Test with a bad-metrics and a good-metrics payload to see the 4 nodes execute vs skip. Credentials needed: None.\n\nSee DAILY_TASKS/DAY_34_Production_Optimization_Mastery.md.",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 540
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "webhook1",
      "name": "Optimization Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        80,
        200
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "path": "advanced-optimization",
        "httpMethod": "POST"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "code1",
      "name": "Compute Optimization Score",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        320,
        200
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "jsCode": "const j = items[0].json;\nconst cpu = j.cpu_percentage || 0;\nconst mem = j.memory_percentage || 0;\nconst disk = j.disk_percentage || 0;\nconst latency = Math.max(1, j.network_latency_ms || 1);\nconst respTime = Math.max(1, j.avg_response_time_ms || 1);\nconst score = Math.round(100 - (cpu * 0.3 + mem * 0.25 + disk * 0.15 + Math.min(latency / 10, 15) + Math.min(respTime / 20, 15)));\nreturn [{ json: { ...j, optimization_score: Math.max(0, Math.min(100, score)) } }];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "if1",
      "name": "Below Threshold?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        560,
        200
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "number": [
            {
              "value1": "={{ Number($json.optimization_score) }}",
              "operation": "smaller",
              "value2": 80
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "set1",
      "name": "Trim Payload",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        800,
        20
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "name": "trim_action",
              "value": "={{ 'trimmed ' + JSON.stringify($json).slice(0, 50) + '...' }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "set2",
      "name": "Dedupe Fields",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        800,
        120
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "name": "dedupe_action",
              "value": "={{ [...new Set(Object.keys($json))].join(',') }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "set3",
      "name": "Round Numbers",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        800,
        220
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "name": "rounded_score",
              "value": "={{ Math.round($json.optimization_score) }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "set4",
      "name": "Flag for Scale Review",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        800,
        320
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "name": "scale_review_flagged",
              "value": true
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "set5",
      "name": "Generate Optimization Report",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        1040,
        200
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "name": "optimization_ran",
              "value": "={{ $('Below Threshold?').item.json.optimization_score < 80 }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "final_score",
              "value": "={{ $('Compute Optimization Score').item.json.optimization_score }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
